---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: Reports
description: My formal, evidence-led security reports.
permalink: /reports/index.html
---
{% block content %}
<section class="page-head">
  <div class="shell narrow">
    <p class="eyebrow">Finished intelligence</p>
    <h1>Reports</h1>
    <p class="lede">This is where I publish long-form investigations. I label historical indicators and keep the limitations visible.</p>
  </div>
</section>
<div class="shell narrow prose">
  {% if collections.reports.length %}
    {% for item in collections.reports %}
      <h2><a href="{{ item.url }}">{{ item.data.title }}</a></h2>
      <p>{{ item.data.description }}</p>
    {% endfor %}
  {% else %}
    <div class="status-note">
      <strong>No public reports yet</strong>
      <p>I am holding the first report while I wait for an external publication decision. I have not republished anything from the previous site without reviewing the evidence again.</p>
    </div>
    <p>My published vulnerability research is in the <a href="/writing/">writing archive</a>. I will use this section for original threat research, incident studies and defensive analysis.</p>
  {% endif %}
</div>
{% endblock %}
